000308r 1  4C rr rr             jmp     sel_moved
00030Br 1  60           @r:     rts
00030Cr 1               
00030Cr 1               ; the selection moved from osel: redraw its two rows (or the whole list if
00030Cr 1               ; it had to scroll)
00030Cr 1               sel_moved:
00030Cr 1  AD rr rr             lda     top
00030Fr 1  8D rr rr             sta     otop
